vsm2.17:60.1:
(II) FORMATIONS

60. Formations are the six mentioned in brief above thus, “the three, namely, formations of merit,
etc., and the three, namely, the bodily formation, etc.” (§44);

vsm2.17:60.2:
but in detail here the first three formations are twenty-nine volitions, that is to say, the formation of merit
consisting of thirteen volitions, counting the eight sense-sphere profitable volitions that occur in giving, in virtue,
etc., and the five fine-material profitable volitions that occur in development of meditation;
